# Redirects for ascendpoint.agency on Kinsta (Sevalla static hosting).
# Format: /from  /to  status. First match wins, so specific rules go above wildcards.
# build.py adds the with/without-trailing-slash twin of every exact rule automatically,
# and tools/test_redirects.py proves every URL the old WordPress site ever published
# (tools/legacy_urls.txt) lands on a real page in one hop.
#
# Pages that kept their WordPress URL need no rule here (/, /about/, /contact/,
# /our-results/, /capabilities/*, /blog/, the four blog posts, and the three
# strategy-session funnel pages).

# --- www -> apex (only takes effect once www.ascendpoint.agency is attached) ---
https://www.ascendpoint.agency/  https://ascendpoint.agency/  301!
https://www.ascendpoint.agency/*  https://ascendpoint.agency/:splat  301!

